# =========================================================
# DO NOT IGNORE PROJECT SOURCE FILES
# =========================================================
#
# Java     -> *.java MUST remain tracked
# React    -> *.jsx / *.js MUST remain tracked
# Python   -> *.py MUST remain tracked
# SQL      -> *.sql MUST remain tracked
# YAML     -> *.yml / *.yaml MUST remain tracked
# Docker   -> Dockerfiles MUST remain tracked
# Terraform -> *.tf MUST remain tracked
#
# =========================================================